{"id":"cargo-help.1","n":"cargo-help","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"cargo","ver":"1.84.1-1.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/c/cargo-1.84.1-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/cargo-help.1.gz","sha256":"bf634258fe7f83e1f9a4342bc121599a02e8404b1d7fc4483646ba571aeb7906","date":"","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":0},"miss":{"r":["--help"]},"desc":"Get help for a Cargo command","r":[["NAME","<p>cargo-help — Get help for a Cargo command</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>cargo help</b> [<i>subcommand</i>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Prints a help message for the given command.</p>"],["EXAMPLES","<div class=\"in\"> 1.Get help for a command:  <div class=\"in\"> <pre>cargo help build</pre> </div> </div>  <div class=\"in\"> 2.Help is also available with the <b>--help</b> flag:  <div class=\"in\"> <pre>cargo build --help</pre> </div> </div>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>cargo</b>(1)</p>"]]}